            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Soup Loving Nicole"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This was a really good salad and makes a nice presentation too. Jicama would have meant making a special trip into the next town over so I left that out. I love jicama though and it would have been great in here. I do think the meat needs marinated longer than called for and I will change that up next time. I also think red onion would have added more color but overall a really good salad and one I would make again.",
